        "topic": null,
        "question_type": "Theory",
        "exam_year": "2020",
        "question_text": "<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:500px\">\r\n\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Marks</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>10 - 19</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>20 - 29</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>30 - 39</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>40 - 49</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>50 - 59</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>60 - 69</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>70 - 79</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>80 - 89</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>90 - 99</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Frequency&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>2</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>2</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>2</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>8</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>13</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>11</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>12</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>10</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>4</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>The table shows the distribution of marks scored by 64 students in a test</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(a) Draw a histogram for the distribution.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(b) Use the histogram to estimate the modal score.</p>",
        "question_image": null,
        "answer_image": null,
        "explanation": "<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:500px\">\r\n\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Class intervals&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>F</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p>Class boundaries</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>10 - 19</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>2</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>9.5 - 19.5</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>20 - 29</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>2</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>19.5 - 29.5</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>30 - 39</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>2</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>29.5 - 39.5</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>40 - 49&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>8</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>39.5 - 49.5</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>50 - 59</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>13</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>49.5 - 59.5</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>60 - 69</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>11</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>59.5 - 69.5</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>70 - 79</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>12</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>69.5 - 79.5</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>80 - 89</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>10</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>79.5 - 89.5</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>90 - 99</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>4</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>89.5 - 99.5</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"https://scontent.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t1.15752-9/p206x206/240675770_177518997812502_8778901898072407169_n.jpg?_nc_cat=107&amp;ccb=1-5&amp;_nc_sid=aee45a&amp;_nc_eui2=AeFRScMl2k7f1eIwab7xQZGlcisAPOMMJHByKwA84wwkcFt3ckdDJ45FlWzfCDLH_Hgz2F4tgBwyt3Z9qOYJ3WwM&amp;_nc_ohc=LWilGO5bh0YAX-8Gjsc&amp;_nc_ad=z-m&amp;_nc_cid=0&amp;_nc_ht=scontent.xx&amp;oh=6fd91d59efb33ebf5c4b4fa31eb994a2&amp;oe=614BF232\" style=\"height:329px; width:350px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(b) The model score = 57</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "reference_passage": null,
        "novel": null,
